  "summary": "作者借《三命通会》乙庚阴阳金木婚配比喻解释有情克与无情克，再引申到斗数：阴阳异性相克相对较轻，同阴或同阳相克较凶，阴阳相生也相对较佳。财与囚仇以廉贞阴火克武曲阴金为例；所有推论保留作者引申及会吉会煞条件。",
  "summary_en": "Using the Yi-Geng Wood-Metal marriage analogy from San Ming Tong Hui, the author distinguishes You Qing Ke from Wu Qing Ke, then extends it to Zi Wei stars. Opposite-polarity overcoming is described as less severe than same-polarity overcoming, and opposite-polarity generation as relatively preferable. Lian Zhen yin Fire overcoming Wu Qu yin Metal illustrates Cai Yu Qiu Chou. These are attributed analogical claims, with auspicious and harmful companions still relevant, not universal findings.",
